            "type": "game",
            "name": "Better Together",
            "steam_appid": 726680,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726680/extras/967b0cc4ec3a18615f4237321d86baa7.avif?t=1793286912\" width=1170 height=278 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have built an entire neighbourhood underground: a social experiment where you and your friends can earn money, do tasks and participate in daily studies together! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We want to watch your group live there for a week. We carefully selected you to participate because we believe there is something in you we can expand upon.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726680/extras/2d81d484355a91f301e73057d74fd1fb.avif?t=1793286912\" width=1170 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's important to be able to express yourself, so your faces can change depending on what mood you select in the mood wheel! You have ten emotions to choose from. If you're scared, you can express your fear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726680/extras/05974bc05ad20461906c75c5e2063a52.avif?t=1793286912\" width=1170 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, there are various studies to attend. Orientation, with questions to get to know your group, who you trust and trust least. Some expand on what you can see and train your instinct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726680/extras/0569ac516af3da9836ba13a85fce20a7.avif?t=1793286912\" width=1170 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between studies there are tasks with deadlines. You have to clean your windows. Mow your beautiful lawn. Take out the trash. The money goes to you and a percentage to the group fund, so the more you work, the more everybody wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726680/extras/45fd0fd7ce1a1b5659af2d1b2fe5bc8e.avif?t=1793286912\" width=1170 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's incredibly important in stressful studies that you have a break from your duties. The most trusted subject gets to host a game night at their table. We have five games to choose from: Go Fish, Never Have I Ever, Truth or Dare, Gossip Wheel and Texas Hold'em (if you feel lucky with the money you've earned from tasks). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726680/extras/3a0b64b14579c7309a4032e70618178b.avif?t=1793286912\" width=1170 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have CCTV cameras in every room, a file on each of you. We pay attention to what you do, we grade you, and note down your routine. We know who trusts you and who doesn't. Who is stabbing you in the back, and who relies on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the end of the week you will know exactly who your friends are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726680/extras/04ebe20ad55f2b53362e34c32d4b171c.avif?t=1793286912\" width=1170 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op for 2 to 6 players, each of you gets your own house &amp; bed to live and sleep in!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat, faces are fully animated to express emotions, with the mood wheel and your voice driving your mouth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily Injections: The Institute offers our &quot;state-of-the-art&quot; clinical formulas to expand what humans are capable of. Expand your vision as you close your eyes. Increase your sprint speed, stamina, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different studies every day: Secret roles, auditory studies and much more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host game nights with your friends: Invite them to Go Fish, Truth or Dare, Never Have I Ever and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vote your Group Leader &amp; Electrician: Your leader takes care of your group fund and your electrician has to make sure the generator is fueled to keep the lights on.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tasks with deadlines, a shared group fund and a shop to buy various items to make your stay as fun as possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A personal diary you can write in, or snoop in others when they are not around.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Respect the Institute's safety measures to ensure your safety in case of any emergency. Lock your doors at night, keep the lights on, and in case anything unusual happens, keep your real friends close...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726680/extras/d915f71e23e845399f5b7e8a3d6145be.avif?t=1793286912\" width=1170 height=208 /></span></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726680/extras/967b0cc4ec3a18615f4237321d86baa7.avif?t=1793286912\" width=1170 height=278 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have built an entire neighbourhood underground: a social experiment where you and your friends can earn money, do tasks and participate in daily studies together! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We want to watch your group live there for a week. We carefully selected you to participate because we believe there is something in you we can expand upon.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726680/extras/2d81d484355a91f301e73057d74fd1fb.avif?t=1793286912\" width=1170 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's important to be able to express yourself, so your faces can change depending on what mood you select in the mood wheel! You have ten emotions to choose from. If you're scared, you can express your fear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726680/extras/05974bc05ad20461906c75c5e2063a52.avif?t=1793286912\" width=1170 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, there are various studies to attend. Orientation, with questions to get to know your group, who you trust and trust least. Some expand on what you can see and train your instinct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726680/extras/0569ac516af3da9836ba13a85fce20a7.avif?t=1793286912\" width=1170 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between studies there are tasks with deadlines. You have to clean your windows. Mow your beautiful lawn. Take out the trash. The money goes to you and a percentage to the group fund, so the more you work, the more everybody wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726680/extras/45fd0fd7ce1a1b5659af2d1b2fe5bc8e.avif?t=1793286912\" width=1170 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's incredibly important in stressful studies that you have a break from your duties. The most trusted subject gets to host a game night at their table. We have five games to choose from: Go Fish, Never Have I Ever, Truth or Dare, Gossip Wheel and Texas Hold'em (if you feel lucky with the money you've earned from tasks). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726680/extras/3a0b64b14579c7309a4032e70618178b.avif?t=1793286912\" width=1170 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have CCTV cameras in every room, a file on each of you. We pay attention to what you do, we grade you, and note down your routine. We know who trusts you and who doesn't. Who is stabbing you in the back, and who relies on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the end of the week you will know exactly who your friends are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726680/extras/04ebe20ad55f2b53362e34c32d4b171c.avif?t=1793286912\" width=1170 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op for 2 to 6 players, each of you gets your own house &amp; bed to live and sleep in!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat, faces are fully animated to express emotions, with the mood wheel and your voice driving your mouth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily Injections: The Institute offers our &quot;state-of-the-art&quot; clinical formulas to expand what humans are capable of. Expand your vision as you close your eyes. Increase your sprint speed, stamina, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different studies every day: Secret roles, auditory studies and much more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host game nights with your friends: Invite them to Go Fish, Truth or Dare, Never Have I Ever and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vote your Group Leader &amp; Electrician: Your leader takes care of your group fund and your electrician has to make sure the generator is fueled to keep the lights on.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tasks with deadlines, a shared group fund and a shop to buy various items to make your stay as fun as possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A personal diary you can write in, or snoop in others when they are not around.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Respect the Institute's safety measures to ensure your safety in case of any emergency. Lock your doors at night, keep the lights on, and in case anything unusual happens, keep your real friends close...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726680/extras/d915f71e23e845399f5b7e8a3d6145be.avif?t=1793286912\" width=1170 height=208 /></span></p>",
            "short_description": "A 2 to 6 player co-op psychological horror. Become neighbors with your friends in an underground experiment. Complete the studies, get paid by doing tasks, while the Institute notes your routine. Betray your friends before they do. In the end you'll know exactly who your friends really are.",
